WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Has intimacy become rare?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Has routine replaced passion?

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.950
Too tired for a cuddle
before you fall asleep?

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.050
Afraid or embarrassed
to talk about your desires?

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.000
Most couples go through this.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.100
You can bring desire and passion
back into your relationship

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.950
with a 14-day challenge.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.750
Simple tasks: honest conversations
and physical connection,

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.250
exploring fantasies
and sensual rituals.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.850
Take the challenge together
to rekindle your passion.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.300
Join us!
